  "functionalCases": [
    "Native literal and UTF-8 regex matching, Unicode simple case folding, explicit whole-word filtering and original-domain anchor context.",
    "Formatting-transparent text domains, scalar-aligned UTF-16 positions, original merged-table source order, captions and exclusion of metadata/hidden tables.",
    "Bounded complete results, guarded captures and navigation, exact whole-AST source binding and pure read-only search without clearing Redo.",
    "Separate Replace One/All native plans; explicit literal or checked capture templates including named/optional groups and zero-width progress.",
    "Linear assembly of each changed text body, affected-ancestor rebuilding and one complete final admission instead of per-hit growth states.",
    "4096 replacements in one local history step under both explicit and natural policies, with exact before/after Undo/Redo and reopen.",
    "Preserved structural identities, untouched formatting, actual directional/node/grid/document selection and pending caret formats.",
    "True identity/no-hit behavior and atomic stale/foreign/read-only/template/expansion/document-limit rejection.",
    "Original local and typing checkpoint families retain semantic branch recipes, not saved regex queries or capture templates.",
    "Generated literal replacement and selection-mapping comparisons against independent string replacement and witnessed ordinary splices."
  ],
